  "dn16:6.7.4": "vācā → sabbatthikavādīnaṃ, masahāparinibbānasutte, evaṃ, dissate:\natha bhagavānuttarāsaṃgataඃ suvarṇavarṇaṃ bāhuṃ nissārya tān bhikṣunavocat: tathāgatasya darśanaṃ loke kadācideva bhavati yathā udumbarapuṣpaṃ kadācideva prādurbhavati aruṇavarṇa- bāhuṃ nissāyya buddhaඃ prādukarot adbhūtaṃ nimittama āgantukā saṃskārāඃ anityā utpadya vinaśyanti mā pramādethāඃ iti tasmād bhikṣavaඃ apramādena sampādayata. nāhaṃ prāmadam tena samyaksambuddhaඃ asaṃkhyeyaguṇo jātaඃ. vyayadharmāඃ saṃskārāඃ apramādena sampādethāඃ iyasmati tathāgatasya paścimā vāk.",
