  "dn16:6.10.22": "ahū”ti → asaṃlīnena kāyena vedanāmadhivāsayan pradyotasyeva vīmokṣastasya cetasaඃ (madhyamikāvānti)",
  "dn16:6.16.2": "cetiyaṃ → uttarena dvārena nagarāt niṣkramya nadiṃ hiraṇyavatīṃ upasaṅkramya mukuṭabandhane caitye (sabbatthivāditaṃ mahāparinibbāṇasutta)",
